  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\nDo you have the Big Dig Energy!? The best co-op mining game with online multiplayer for up to 4 players! Team up, dig deep, mine energy ore, and upgrade your tools. Reach the planets core to fuel the rocket and leave Earth!<p></p>\n<p>There’s no rush, no rules – just beards and Big Dig Energy. Get ready to dig like you’ve never dug before!</p>\n<p><b>Game Features</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Dig Deep – Smash through layers of dirt, rock, and volatile terrain. The deeper you dig, the more powerful the energy ores and rare treasures you’ll uncover.\n</li><li>Upgrades – Your puny starter tools won’t cut it in the depths. Hurl ores into the furnace to generate energy, upgrade your gear, and dig like a legendary dwarf should.\n</li><li>4-Player Co-Op – Who needs solo mining when you can bring your crew? Team up with up to 3 other dwarves, gain energy, and experience underground mayhem together.\n</li><li>Dig Smart – It’s not just about digging deep, it’s about digging smart. Plan your route and blast your way back to the surface with your pack full.\n</li></ul>\n",
